<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-COOLUM CLASSIC LEADING FINAL ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-COOLUM CLASSIC LEADING FINAL ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>COOLUM, Australia 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading final round</p>
<p>scores and totals in the Coolum Classic golf tournament at the</p>
<p>par-72 Hyatt Resort course on Sunday (Australian unless stated):</p>
<p>280 Anthony Painter 71 68 68 73</p>
<p>282 Matthew Ecob 75 72 70 65</p>
<p>283 Michael Clayton 70 73 71 69, Gary Evans (Britain) 70 74 71</p>
<p>68, Greg Chalmers 71 66 75 71, Michael Long (New Zealand)</p>
<p>72 67 71 73, Rodney Pampling 69 67 73 74</p>
<p>284 Stephen Leaney 72 67 73 72, Peter Lonard 67 71 73 73,</p>
<p>Stuart Bouvier 69 73 69 73</p>
<p>285 Wayne Grady 66 73 72 74</p>
<p>286 Darren Barnes 75 69 72 70, David Ecob 70 74 72 70, Stuart</p>
<p>Appleby 68 69 78 71, Martyn Roberts 71 68 76 71, Philip</p>
<p>Chapman</p>
<p>67 74 71 74</p>
<p>287 Paul Devenport (New Zealand) 73 70 73 71</p>
<p>288 Jeff Woodland 71 76 72 69, Chris Gray 73 70 74 71, Lucas</p>
<p>Parsons 72 73 72 71, Craig Jones 70 72 73 73.</p>
